print("Split Bill Calculator")
#Prints the heading "Split Bill Calculator"

billTotal = int(input("How much is the bill?: "))
#Asks how much the bill is and assigns it as an integer to the variable billTotal

people = int(input("How many people?: "))
#Asks how many people will split the bill and assigns it as an integer to the variable people.

billSplit = round(billTotal/people, 2)
#To calculate how much each person owes, the billTotal is divided by people.
#It is then rounded to two decimal places, as money is usually displayed that way.
#It is then saved to the variable billSplit.

print("You each owe", billSplit)
#Prints the amount each person owes.
